'''Pouch Guidance'''{{Unofficial}} is a type of [[Spells|spell]] that guides [[Pouch of Calling|Pouches of Calling]] to the location of the seal. It is referred to as a type of [[Guidance Seal]].

==Description==
The casting seal contains a Sigil of [[Sigils_Explained#Guidance|Guidance]], two Signs of [[Signs Explained#Level_Planes|Level Planes]] and two Signs of [[Signs Explained#Columns|Columns]]. It also includes two nested seals for [[Pouch of Calling|Pouches of Calling]] The spell targets objects with the Pouch of Calling Seal and causes them to flee towards the direction of the planted spell.{{Ref|m|81|9}}

==Usage==
The seal is planted within a forest near the [[Ezrest]] Hillside, meant to guide Pouches of Callings warmed by [[Snugstone|Snugstones]] and wailing for their lives within the range of the giant [[Valance Leech Counterclock|Counterclock seal]]. This is done to bait and lure the [[Valance Leech (Monster)|Valance Leech]] into the spell's radius.{{Ref|m|81|9}}
